= SCP Foundation

- @build: Build a Front Company to help us in hiring experts in their field.
- @expand: Expand the SCP Foundation to accommodate for more personnels or anomalies
- @root: We don't need to form contracts for now.
- @easy_discard

@build
subtitle: -1 budget
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough budget.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; build += 1

We have decided to build a Front Company. This will make hiring researchers, engineers and military combatants easier in the future. [? if build == 1 : Hi Im testing this. ?]

@expand
subtitle: -1 budget
choose-if: budget >= 1
